                                "sense_id": "6de1392a-d5b6-38c9-a88f-371f4fd0e8f0",
                                "text": "To sailors, oaths are household words; they will swear in the trance of the calm, and in the teeth of the tempest; they will imprecate curses from the topsail-yard-arms, when most they teeter over to a seething sea; [...]"
                            }
                        ]
